From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:51:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] v4l2-compliance: detect AVS2 stateless decoders

Same as for the other downstream stateless formats: an unknown AVS2
(V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS2_FRAME, 'AVS2') output format ended the codec
detection, so cedrus and rkvdec AVS2 nodes were tested as stateful and
failed VIDIOC_(TRY_)DECODER_CMD. Kept as its own patch for the joint
AVS2 uAPI series (cedrus + rkvdec VDPU381).

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp b/utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp
index 5555076..b6fcc5c 100644
--- a/utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp
+++ b/utils/v4l2-compliance/v4l2-compliance.cpp
@@ -52,6 +52,9 @@
 #ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS_FRAME
 #define V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS_FRAME	v4l2_fourcc('A', 'V', 'S', 'F')
 #endif
+#ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS2_FRAME
+#define V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS2_FRAME	v4l2_fourcc('A', 'V', 'S', '2')
+#endif
 #include <media-info.h>
 #include <v4l-getsubopt.h>
 
@@ -621,6 +624,7 @@ static void determine_codec_mask(struct node &node)
 			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_H263_SLICE:
 			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_SPK_SLICE:
 			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS_FRAME:
+			case V4L2_PIX_FMT_AVS2_FRAME:
 				mask |= STATELESS_DECODER;
 				break;
 			default:
